# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Westfall

step Smith Argus
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip West out of Redridge by Three Corners and along the road through Elwynn to Goldshire: Smith Argus works at the smithy.
  turnin 118                                  -- Smith Argus
  accept 119

step Sentinel Hill
  zone Westfall
  tip West through Westbrook into Westfall and down the road to Sentinel Hill. Gryan Stoutmantle stands at the top of the stone tower.
  turnin 132                                  -- Gryan Stoutmantle
